      },
      "expectations": {
        "expected_behavior": "Empathize with concern. Ask clarifying questions: What kind of progress expected? Tracking metrics (weight, measurements, strength gains)? Following nutrition plan? Getting adequate sleep/recovery? Explain that 4 weeks is early, visible changes typically take 6-8+ weeks. Offer to review progress data if available. Encouraging, realistic tone.",
